Hi Sebastian,

Thanks for the feedback.
This issue has been solved in the latest release of the package <https://github.com/joaofgoncalves/SegOptim> thanks to the contribution of GitHub user arthurdegrandpre <https://github.com/arthurdegrandpre>. Please reinstall the package using:

remotes::install_github("joaofgoncalves/SegOptim", ref="experimental")

After reinstalling the package the example should be working (I tested it on my computer and it performs well in all steps).

Cheers,
João

